0070"},{"id":3200069,"title":"特朗普说美空管系统故障与网络攻击无关","extra":{"date":1794617648000},"url":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3200069"},{"id":3200068,"title":"美联储副主席Jefferson：根据我的经验，债务或赤字问题从未进入过美联储的政策辩论中。\n\n在我参加过的联邦公开市场委员会（FOMC）会议上，从未出现过政治因素介入讨论的情况。\n\nFOMC将在几个月内（甚至更早）听取美联储特别工作组的汇报。\n\n人工智能（AI）建设使我不得不关注总需求，而总需求正是通胀压力的来源。","extra":{"date":1794617552000},"url":"https://wallstreetcn.com/livenews/3200068"}],"info":{"LICENCE":"MIT","Github":"https://github.com/ourongxing/newsnow","Sponsorship":"If you rely on this service, sponsorship is welcome to help it run for the long term. Scan the QR code https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ourongxing/newsnow/main/screenshots/reward.gif"}}
